<title>USA: MATIF to set 5-year futures launch date next week.</title>
<headline>MATIF to set 5-year futures launch date next week.</headline>
<dateline>BOCA RATON, Fla. 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>French financial futures and options exchange MATIF SA will announce next week when it plans to launch its futures contract on five-year French franc notes, Gerard Pfauwadel, MATIF chairman, said Friday.</p>
<p>&quot;We will announce next week the exact date,&quot; Pfauwadel told a news briefing at a derivatives conference here.</p>
</text>
